# Well-known bus names schema-init runs as first-class managed services.
# schema-dbus refuses to bus-activate any name listed here, so the managed
# daemon owns the name uncontested and never races a broker-spawned copy.
# One name per line; # comments and blank lines ignored.
#
# polkitd is not masked:
# /usr/local/share/dbus-1/system-services/org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1.service
# routes its activation to PID 1 (schema-bus-activate starts polkitd.svc and
# waits for the name), so an early caller waits instead of failing.
